    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for RAG-layer context-window budget management. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations track a fixed token budget and allow retrieval workers to reserve slices of that budget via RAII <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_budget_handle" kindref="compound">BudgetHandle</ref></computeroutput>s. The hard-limit enforcement prevents context-stuffing: if a retrieval worker requests more tokens than are available, <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_budget_exhausted_error" kindref="compound">BudgetExhaustedError</ref></computeroutput> is thrown. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
